(INVOICE MANAGEMENT MODULE DOCUMENT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Iconic Hishab Accounting Software) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Prepared date: 14-Sep-2026) Tj
T*
(Version: 1.0) Tj
T*
(Audience: Developers, QA, support, deployment/admin users.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Module Overview) Tj
T*
(==================) Tj
T*
(The Invoice Management module manages customer invoices from draft to final accounting) Tj
T*
(posting. It includes invoice creation, item editing, customer selection, due collection,) Tj
T*
(refund, payment history, invoice cancellation/restoration, summary reporting, print/PDF) Tj
T*
(generation, and permission-based menu access.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Navigation) Tj
T*
(=============) Tj
T*
( - Main menu: Invoice.) Tj
T*
(- Submenus: All Invoices, Create Invoice, Draft Invoices, Due Invoices, Paid Invoices,) Tj
T*
(Overdue Invoices, Invoice Summary Report.) Tj
T*
( - All invoice submenu selections should display active tick/selection state.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Frontend Pages) Tj
T*
(=================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Component | Route/Use | Key Behavior) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(InvoiceList.tsx | /invoices and filtered status views | Shows invoice no, customer name,) Tj
T*
(item names, date, total, paid, due, status, action buttons; no print/PDF buttons.) Tj
T*
(CreateInvoice.tsx | /invoices/create and /invoices/:id/edit | Create, save draft, finalize) Tj
T*
(draft, edit final invoice totals, collect due, refund, edit payments, customer + shortcut.) Tj
T*
(InvoiceDetails.tsx | /invoices/:id | Read view with top action buttons, invoice items,) Tj
T*
(payment history, related vouchers.) Tj
T*
(InvoiceSummaryReport.tsx | /invoices/reports/summary | Date/status filtered report with) Tj
T*
(totals, refund total, print/PDF.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Backend API Endpoints) Tj
T*
(========================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Method | Endpoint | Purpose) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(POST | /api/v1/invoices | Create final or draft invoice.) Tj
T*
(GET | /api/v1/invoices | Paginated invoice list with search/status/branch filters.) Tj
T*
(GET | /api/v1/invoices/reports/summary | Invoice summary report.) Tj
T*
(GET | /api/v1/invoices/:id | Invoice detail with items, payments, vouchers, audit logs.) Tj
T*
(PUT | /api/v1/invoices/:id | Update draft or final invoice details according to rules.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
