(POST | /api/v1/invoices/:id/finalize | Finalize draft and post vouchers.) Tj
T*
(POST | /api/v1/invoices/:id/payments | Collect due payment and create receipt voucher.) Tj
T*
(PUT | /api/v1/invoices/:id/payments/:paymentId | Edit a payment entry and recalculate) Tj
T*
(invoice.) Tj
T*
(POST | /api/v1/invoices/:id/refund | Post refund and create payment voucher.) Tj
T*
(POST | /api/v1/invoices/:id/cancel | Cancel invoice and reverse accounting postings.) Tj
T*
(POST | /api/v1/invoices/:id/restore-draft | Restore cancelled invoice as draft.) Tj
T*
(DELETE | /api/v1/invoices/:id | Delete Draft or Cancelled invoice only.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Database Entities) Tj
T*
(====================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Entity | Purpose | Relationship) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Invoice | Master invoice header and monetary/status totals | Has many items, payments,) Tj
T*
(vouchers, audit logs.) Tj
T*
(InvoiceItem | Line items for products/services/custom entries | Belongs to Invoice; deleted) Tj
T*
(with invoice.) Tj
T*
(InvoicePayment | Payment and refund history | Belongs to Invoice; may link to Voucher.) Tj
T*
(InvoiceVoucher | Bridge between invoice and accounting voucher | Stores postingType and) Tj
T*
(amount.) Tj
T*
(InvoiceAuditLog | Operational trace history | Belongs to Invoice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Accounting Posting Rules) Tj
T*
(===========================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Event | Posting Type | Voucher Type | Expected Result) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Final create/finalize with initial paid amount | INITIAL_PAID | Receipt | Cash/bank receipt) Tj
T*
(recorded and paid amount increased.) Tj
T*
(Final create/finalize with due amount | INITIAL_DUE | Journal | Customer receivable) Tj
T*
(recorded.) Tj
T*
(Later due collection | COLLECTION | Receipt | Payment history row and receipt voucher) Tj
T*
(linked.) Tj
T*
(Refund | REFUND | Payment | Refund shown in payment history/report and linked to voucher.) Tj
T*
(Cancel final invoice | REVERSAL | Journal/related reversal | Active invoice postings) Tj
T*
(reversed and invoice marked cancelled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Status Flow) Tj
T*
(==============) Tj
T*
(DRAFT -> finalized to DUE/PARTIALLY_PAID/PAID depending on payment. DUE/PARTIALLY_PAID can) Tj
T*
(become PAID after collections or recalculation. Final invoices can be CANCELLED with) Tj
T*
(reversal. CANCELLED invoices can be restored to DRAFT. OVERDUE is used when due date passes) Tj
T*
(while due amount remains.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Page Behavior Rules) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
