(======================) Tj
T*
( - View Invoice keeps Edit Invoice, Cancel Invoice, Print, PDF, and Back buttons.) Tj
T*
(- Collect due payment, refund form, and payment history action/edit controls belong to Edit) Tj
T*
(Invoice page.) Tj
T*
( - Payment history itself appears in View Invoice above Related Vouchers.) Tj
T*
( - Full paid invoice Edit button is disabled instead of hidden.) Tj
T*
( - Print/PDF buttons are removed from invoice list actions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. Validation Rules) Tj
T*
(===================) Tj
T*
( - customerId and branchId are required positive integers.) Tj
T*
( - At least one invoice item is required.) Tj
T*
( - Quantity must be a whole number and minimum 1.) Tj
T*
(- Payment/refund amount must be greater than 0 and cannot exceed applicable business limits.) Tj
T*
( - Draft payment collection and draft refund are blocked until finalization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. Permission Matrix) Tj
T*
(=====================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Action | Permission | Notes) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Create invoice/save draft | Invoice create | Also requires branch create permission.) Tj
T*
(View list/detail/report | Invoice read | Also requires branch read permission for) Tj
T*
(list/report.) Tj
T*
(Edit/finalize/cancel/restore/payment/refund | Invoice update | Mutating operations require) Tj
T*
(branch permission.) Tj
T*
(Delete draft/cancelled | Invoice delete | Should be assigned carefully beyond SuperAdmin.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11. QA Checklist) Tj
T*
(================) Tj
T*
( - Create invoice with unpaid, partial paid, and full paid examples.) Tj
T*
( - Save draft and confirm no vouchers are created until finalization.) Tj
T*
( - Collect multiple payments on different dates and verify history/report.) Tj
T*
( - Refund and verify summary report refund total and payment history.) Tj
T*
( - Edit item rate/quantity after partial payment and verify paid/due/status recalculation.) Tj
T*
( - Cancel final invoice and verify reversal vouchers and audit logs.) Tj
T*
( - Check list responsiveness on small mobile/laptop screens.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(12. Deployment Notes) Tj
T*
(====================) Tj
T*
( - Apply invoice database migrations before enabling invoice routes in production.) Tj
T*
( - Sync Invoice permissions and assign required roles.) Tj
T*
( - Do not modify Docker/deployment files without explicit approval from the project owner.) Tj
T*
ET
